WEBVTT

00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:07.390
Ha-ha!

00:00:11.230 --> 00:00:12.230
Yeah!

00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:15.590
[crowd shouting and cheering]

00:00:20.510 --> 00:00:23.790
[girls chattering and giggling]

00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:26.190
Hey, McQueen...
Eat your heart out.

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:28.470
[gasping] Oh!

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:29.910
Let me get this straight.

00:00:29.990 --> 00:00:32.910
I can go when this road is done.
That's the deal, right?

00:00:32.990 --> 00:00:36.710
- That's what they done did said.
- OK. Outta my way.

00:00:36.790 --> 00:00:37.870
I got a road to finish.

00:00:39.190 --> 00:00:41.590
[grunting and revving]

00:00:49.710 --> 00:00:52.150
- He's done!
- Done?

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:54.550
- Uh-huh.
- It's only been an hour.

00:00:56.510 --> 00:00:59.830
- [Bessie groans]
- Ah, I'm done. Look, I'm finished.

00:00:59.910 --> 00:01:02.790
Say thanks, and I'll be on my way.
That's all you gotta say.

00:01:03.390 --> 00:01:07.070
[Mater] Whee-hoo!
I'm the first one on the new road!

00:01:07.590 --> 00:01:09.230
Oh!

00:01:10.550 --> 00:01:13.230
[vibrating] It rides purty smooth.

00:01:13.510 --> 00:01:16.950
- It looks awful!
- Well, it matches the rest of the town.

00:01:17.070 --> 00:01:20.590
- Oh!
- [blubbering]

00:01:20.910 --> 00:01:22.910
Red.

00:01:25.550 --> 00:01:26.870
Who do you think you are?

00:01:26.910 --> 00:01:30.270
Look, Doc said when I finish,
I could go. That was the deal.

00:01:30.310 --> 00:01:33.750
The deal was you fix the road,
not make it worse.

00:01:33.790 --> 00:01:36.270
Now, scrape it off!
Start over again.

00:01:36.350 --> 00:01:39.990
Hey, look, grandpa,
I'm not a bulldozer. I'm a racecar.

00:01:40.070 --> 00:01:41.550
Oh-ho-ho-ho!

00:01:41.590 --> 00:01:45.870
Is that right? Then why don't we
just have a little race? Me and you.

00:01:45.950 --> 00:01:49.750
- What?
- [chuckling] Me and you. That a joke?

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:52.150
If you win, you go and I fix the road.

00:01:52.230 --> 00:01:54.950
If I win, you do the road my way.

00:01:54.990 --> 00:01:56.550
Doc, what're you doin'?

00:01:56.910 --> 00:01:58.750
I don't mean to be rude here,

00:01:58.790 --> 00:02:02.550
but you probably go zero to sixty in,
like, what? Three-point-five years?

00:02:02.630 --> 00:02:05.110
Then I reckon
you ain't got nothin' to worry about.

00:02:05.190 --> 00:02:09.870
You know what, old-timer?
That's a wonderful idea. Let's race.

00:02:11.630 --> 00:02:14.150
[Sheriff] Gentlemen,
this will be a one-lap race.

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:18.710
You will drive to Willy's Butte,
go around Willy's Butte and come back.

00:02:18.790 --> 00:02:21.710
There will be no bumpin',
no cheatin', no spittin',

00:02:21.830 --> 00:02:24.310
no bitin', no road rage, no maimin',

00:02:24.390 --> 00:02:29.510
no oil slickin', no pushin', no shovin',
no backstabbin', no road-hoggin',

00:02:29.590 --> 00:02:31.350
and no lollygaggin'.

00:02:31.430 --> 00:02:32.990
Speed. I'm speed.

00:02:33.070 --> 00:02:35.670
Float like a Cadillac,
sting like a Beemer.

00:02:35.710 --> 00:02:36.750
[Luigi laughs]

00:02:36.870 --> 00:02:41.670
My friend Guido, he dream to give
a real racecar a pit stop.

00:02:41.750 --> 00:02:44.310
- Peet stop!
- Uh... [chuckles]

00:02:44.310 --> 00:02:47.190
The race is only one lap, guys.

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:49.790
Uno lappo! Don't need any help.

00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:53.670
- I work solo mio.
- Fine. Race your way.

00:02:55.030 --> 00:02:58.830
- No pit stoppo. Comprendo?
- OK.

00:02:58.950 --> 00:03:00.990
Gentlemen...

00:03:01.590 --> 00:03:04.430
...start your engines!

00:03:06.550 --> 00:03:08.230
[engine sputters]

00:03:08.710 --> 00:03:11.150
[revving furiously]

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:13.590
- ¡Hijole! Check that out!
- Whoa.

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:16.750
Great idea, Doc.
Now the road will never get done.

00:03:17.110 --> 00:03:18.390
Luigi?

00:03:18.470 --> 00:03:21.710
[chuckling] On your mark, get set...

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:23.990
Uno for the money,
due for the show,

00:03:24.030 --> 00:03:29.750
tre to get ready, and quattro
to... I can't believe it. Go!

00:03:31.070 --> 00:03:32.230
[giggling]

00:03:33.790 --> 00:03:35.710
[cheering]

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:39.550
Huh?

00:03:40.230 --> 00:03:42.710
Doc... the flag means go.

00:03:42.790 --> 00:03:46.150
Remember the fl...
Here we go. Go.

00:03:46.230 --> 00:03:48.950
Doc, what are you doing, man?

00:03:49.030 --> 00:03:52.550
Oh, dear. It would seem
I'm off to a poor start.

00:03:52.630 --> 00:03:55.790
Well, better late than never.
Come on, Mater.

00:03:55.870 --> 00:03:58.630
- Might need a little help.
- Uh... OK.

00:04:00.310 --> 00:04:01.750
You got your tow cable?

00:04:01.830 --> 00:04:04.030
Well, yeah,
I always got my tow cable. Why?

00:04:04.070 --> 00:04:06.430
[Doc] Oh, just in case.

00:04:14.910 --> 00:04:17.150
[yelling] Ow! Ow!
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow.

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:18.910
No, no, no, no, no!

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:21.470
- Oh, man!
- Whoa.

00:04:22.230 --> 00:04:24.510
- Ow!
- [Fillmore] Bad trip, man.

00:04:24.590 --> 00:04:26.030
[revving]

00:04:27.670 --> 00:04:33.670
Hey! Was that floatin' like a Cadillac
or was that stingin' like a Beemer?

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:36.110
- I'm confused.
- [chuckling]

00:04:36.190 --> 00:04:38.270
[Doc] You drive like you fix roads.

00:04:38.350 --> 00:04:41.590
Lousy! Have fun fishin', Mater.

00:04:45.350 --> 00:04:47.190
[gasps] Ah!

00:04:47.950 --> 00:04:50.910
I'm startin' to think he knowed
you was gonna crash!

00:04:50.950 --> 00:04:54.110
Thank you, Mater. Thank you.

00:04:57.230 --> 00:04:59.150
I can make a little turn on dirt.

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:00.630
You think?

00:05:00.710 --> 00:05:05.190
No. And now I'm a day behind.
I'm never gonna get outta here!

00:05:05.270 --> 00:05:07.710
Hey, ése!
You need a new paint job, man!

00:05:07.830 --> 00:05:10.790
- [Lightning] No, thank you.
- How 'bout some organic fuel?

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:13.190
- That freak juice?
- [Lightning] Pass.

00:05:13.270 --> 00:05:17.750
Whoo! Watchin' him is makin' me thirsty.
Anybody else want somethin' to drink?

00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:19.390
Nah, not me, Flo.

00:05:19.470 --> 00:05:21.950
I'm on one of them there special diets.

00:05:21.990 --> 00:05:26.630
I'm a precisional instrument
of speed and aero-matics.

00:05:27.150 --> 00:05:29.470
"You race like you fix roads."

00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:34.310
[grunting] I'll show him.
[grunting] I will show him!

00:05:42.630 --> 00:05:46.990
- [tar splattering]
- Oh, great! I hate it!

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:50.670
- Hate, hate, hate, hate it!
- [chuckles] Music. Sweet music.

00:05:51.870 --> 00:05:54.430
Maybe this wasn't such a good idea.

00:05:54.510 --> 00:05:57.230
[Lightning]
Radiator Springs, a happy place!

00:05:57.310 --> 00:06:00.350
OK, Bessie, you think that's funny?

00:06:02.870 --> 00:06:06.710
Great! I'm talking to Bessie now!
I'm talking to Bessie!

